{"title":"2003 OIM Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sequences <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/8/8b805f8cf0c3429cf15fd3c4f8ddccb951fa63a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_n)_{n \\ge 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"61\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/d/d4d184ee8aefed23647eb68e0e04e6f37c31ffd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b_n)_{n \\ge 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"59\" height=\"20\" /> are defined by:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/e/c6e6af268ab953f1fbc3de325f74019c3d5317fa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_0=1 \\text{, }b_0=4\\text{, and}\\]\" width=\"145\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e31f66225c73b04cc439fb8e2f77f0ae18fbc3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_{n+1}=a_n^{2001}+b_n\\text{,  for }n \\ge 0\\text{.}\\]\" width=\"218\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b62307a6806d57e18e7a905ac1f1e2b126621e88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b_{n+1}=b_n^{2001}+a_n\\text{,  for }n \\ge 0\\text{.}\\]\" width=\"216\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Show that 2003 does not divide any of the terms of these sequences.\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2003_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017202602\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 41/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 957/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.620      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.620      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26169:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017202602 and revision id 207239. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}